1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,744
At 52, she wasn't afraid of being alone.

2
00:00:03,744 --> 00:00:06,569
She was afraid of choosing wrong again.

3
00:00:06,569 --> 00:00:11,009
After a painful relationship, even a kind invitation felt risky.

4
00:00:11,009 --> 00:00:14,756
When someone asked her to dinner, she nearly said no—

5
00:00:14,756 --> 00:00:19,521
not because she didn't want love,
but because she remembered the cost.

6
00:00:19,521 --> 00:00:21,977
Then she asked herself:

7
00:00:21,977 --> 00:00:26,027
"What if protecting my heart
means never giving it a chance?"

8
00:00:26,027 --> 00:00:28,600
She didn't promise herself a happy ending.

9
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:31,045
She said yes to one coffee.

10
00:00:31,045 --> 00:00:34,200
Because starting over doesn't mean trusting everyone.

11
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,811
It means learning from the past
without letting it choose your future.

